Happy to archive the benchmark data. What I need from you: (1) a Zenodo API token (zenodo.org → Settings/Log in → Access tokens — scoped to 'deposit:actions') or ok to prepare everything for manual upload; (2) metadata preferences: title, description, license (e.g. CC-BY-4.0), and author list. I will prepare, per dataset, a package with PROVENANCE (origin, filters, preparation commands), md5 checksums, sizes, and a deposit-ready JSON, and document the exact upload steps in the repo. Ready now: the small 94 MB dataset (300 contigs). Later: medium 3,000-contig set, COMEBin demo inputs, and CAMI II marine sample-0 inputs — each packaged after its run. Sandbox (sandbox.zenodo.org) is recommended for a dry run first. Can you create the token, or prefer manual upload?
